[0.001, "o", "Deadlock cycle detected:\r\r\n  → Task #2 → Resource#1 → Task #1\r\r\n    Task #1 → Resource#2 → Task #2\r\r\n\r\r\n2 tasks and 2 resources involved\r\r\n\r\r\nResources involved:\r\r\n  - Mutex 'mutex_a' (Resource#1) @ 0x6000026e4850\r\r\n  - Mutex 'mutex_b' (Resource#2) @ 0x6000026e4890\r\r\n\r\r\nð Suggestions:\r\r\n  • Acquire locks in consistent order (always A before B)\r\r\n  • Use try_lock() with timeout\r\r\n  • Consider lock-free data structures\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1;93m=== Scenario 2: Proper Lock Ordering (No Deadlock) ===\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
